# 统一换行符，避免不同系统 clone 之后出现整文件"被修改"的假 diff
#
# 规则：
#   - .bat / .cmd 必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析会出问题
#   - 其余文本文件统一 LF，跨平台干净
#   - 图片等二进制文件不做换行转换
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.safetensors binary
*.bin binary
*.spm binary
